{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1046442-mage-sight-descriptions-for-resonant-anchor-condition","id":1046442,"title":"Mage Sight Descriptions for Resonant & Anchor Condition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-02-09T13:06:00-08:00","id":1046442,"title":"Mage Sight Descriptions for Resonant & Anchor Condition","content":"Hey everyone,<br /> <br /> So, according to the AMS Mages are able to see Anchor and Resonant Conditions on locations. How do you go about describing these?<br /> <br /> I was trying to think of some ways to described them and for one person they were anchored to a construction site, how would this look? Would the entire area be viewed in a pale glow that indicates something special about this area?<br /> <br /> Just brainstorming any help is definitely appreciated!<br /> <br /> Thanks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Teamwork makes the dream work!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4720-taldorblackfire","name":"Taldorblackfire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4720_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-09T13:41:19-08:00","id":1046462,"title":"","content":"Resonant Conditions are everywhere, it would be a glut of colors and imagery.<br /> <br /> Anchor would, at least, be easier, with imagery of the ghost or things that represent it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 02-09-2017, 04:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-09T14:07:20-08:00","id":1046471,"title":"","content":"Remember that you only have to describe things that are significant- that principle made Mage Sight much easier for me as an ST. Everywhere might be Resonant within the fiction of the game, but you only need to say &quot;this one place looks particularly interesting.&quot;<br /> <br /> As for description, when I think &quot;Anchor&quot; I think of weight, so maybe describe it as seeming heavy, a little gravity well, denser and deeper and darker than the surrounding area, like it can't move on with the rest of the world. &quot;Resonant&quot; makes me think of sounds and musical tones, so maybe describe it as having a quiet hum or frequency or echo that reminds the PC of the thing it's Resonant with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-09T20:24:21-08:00","id":1046604,"title":"","content":"Resonant's flavor of weirdness among the common Manifestation Conditions is that it's more useful to describe its relation to its ephemeral beings backwards \u2014 it's more important that a spirit of fire treats all fires as Resonant than that a fire is Resonant to fire spirits. That being said, an <i>occupied</i> Resonant Condition is going to take cues from its resident spirit; much like how a Spirit Manse is heavily colored by its creator's Path and Nimbus, a Resonant Condition sustained by a particular spirit is going to look <i>appropriate</i> for that spirit.<br /> <br /> Shells and crypts are already part and parcel of Moros Sight, but I feel like as a general phenomenon Anchors are going to seem like persistent distraction \u2014 ephemeral beings keep coming back to these things for a reason.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-10T08:31:01-08:00","id":1046787,"title":"","content":"It really depends on how much metaphorical/trippy you want Mage Sight to be. I also try to make Mage Sight a personal experience by incorporating symbolism from his Shadow Name and Path (or more importantly, stuff from his awakening) as well as what he is looking at/for.<br /> <br /> example:<br /> An Obrimos named Daedalus that activates Mage Sight to see the electricity behind the socket, sees blue energy &quot;melting&quot; the wall like wax (In mythology Daedalus created wings of wax)<br /> <br /> For me, anchors (like the literal item) are &quot;chains&quot; that &quot;bind&quot; an entity's leftovers into a state of &quot;No Change&quot;.<br /> <br /> So, when someone uses Death Sight on an achor at a contruction site...<br /> <i>...a howling wind seems to emerge as you open your eyes through Stygia.-------------- </i>/the Active Mage Sight; Letting Death shape your vision<br /> <i>The whole contruction site seems darker, colder and at constant change, except -----</i>/the energies of Death; Death in tarot is Change, not just literal death<br /> <i>from a remote contruction office building nearby. The fragile container is ruined --------</i>/the target of the player's Focus<br /> <i>from a bunch of large thick steel beams that may have fallen from the crane above. </i>/some plossible reason of the event<br /> <i>You feel the air around the container heavy, deprived of change, deprived of death, --</i>/Ghosts do not change, defying what death (Stygia) does to mortals<br /> <i>unnaturally fettered in the mortal world. You hear multiple chains rattling closer and --</i>/the chains are a metaphor of their anchored state<br /> <i>and closer and faint whispers from entities that once where whole. --------------------------</i>/Ghosts also lack a soul, that which makes a peson whole","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6169,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6169-shadowjim12","user":"Shadowjim12","date":". 02-10-2017, 11:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6169-shadowjim12","name":"Shadowjim12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}